The scenarios of Test 77's change, as tests/test_toy_wire_integration.c printed them (first of its two passes):
  ordinary reads one behind the other: the second opens a window with no card command; 6 requests of 9 served from 3 windows, 106 sectors; given up for a read elsewhere, for one of 61 sectors and at the track's end; CMD18 4, CMD12 3
  reads that reach over the track's end, the game's EXEC call first: never the window's, one at an open window's first sector and one that opened a window for itself; both read by the low reader, exact
  reads that reach over the track's end, the game's CHECK call first: never the window's, one at an open window's first sector and one that opened a window for itself; both read by the low reader, exact
  the same over scattered extents, stall every ~0 bytes, 0% busy phases: 27 requests, 26 from the window; streams 48, ends close/jump/sector/frame 1/47/0/0, windows 1, CMD18 50, CMD12 49
  the same over scattered extents, stall every ~1500 bytes, 20% busy phases: 27 requests, 26 from the window; streams 101, ends close/jump/sector/frame 1/45/43/12, windows 1, CMD18 117, CMD12 116
  the same over scattered extents, stall every ~150 bytes, 80% busy phases: 27 requests, 26 from the window; streams 451, ends close/jump/sector/frame 0/18/286/147, windows 1, CMD18 515, CMD12 514
  a window and the movie's file: one opened ahead of the file served 30 sectors into it, one opened inside it 71 sectors to behind its end, counted as that movie's; one opened by a read over the file's end counted with the others
  commands between consecutive reads: a window given up for a command that is not a read (3), ended by INIT, RESET and an abort, never opened across a seek, and reopened by the next consecutive read: 8 windows
  8 ordinary reads the game waited for with interrupts held off: the first the low reader's, then one window and one stream, 7 kept waiting for the wire, 29 rounds of the game's loop
  a token search left standing by a read the game ended, the game then asking again with the player's polls: no window on top of it, the low reader's read in 70 rounds, the next read's window as ever
  a token search left standing by a read the game ended, the game then asking again with EXEC and CHECK: no window on top of it, the low reader's read in 70 rounds, the next read's window as ever
  a token search left standing by a read the game ended, the game then asking again with no call at all: no window on top of it, the low reader's read in 63 rounds, the next read's window as ever
  ordinary reads served in an interrupt visit and reported by the game's next call: 3, the window kept through each
  the card asked of the reader with a window open, its stream standing still: window given up, stream stopped, CMD12, the card handed over; given back, the game reads on and has a window again
  the card asked of the reader with a window open, its stream receiving: window given up, stream stopped, CMD12, the card handed over; given back, the game reads on and has a window again
  the card's stop command failing once as a window is given up for a read elsewhere: the window closed, the command sent again by the low reader, the read exact; CMD12 2
  no window with the SCI route not selected: ten consecutive reads, all the low reader's, one CMD18
  no window with another title: ten consecutive reads, all the low reader's, one CMD18
  no window with a source the stage did not find raw: ten consecutive reads, all the low reader's, one CMD18
  no window with a track of 2,048-byte sectors on a disc whose movie track is raw: ten consecutive reads, all the low reader's, one CMD18
  a movie's start as the game reads it: a read of 61 sectors by the low reader, the first refill a window with no card command; played again after its end, a second window; 12 refills served
  movie ended under a waiting request: the window served it and stayed, no card command
  window in error under a waiting request: stream stopped in the interrupt visit, CMD12 later, read exact
  another read in the middle of the movie: stream stopped, CMD12 from the foreground, read exact

The same build without STAY (matrix job t77nostay):
  8 ordinary reads the game waited for with interrupts held off: 7 windows opened and given up, the low reader read them all, 25 rounds of the game's loop
